Hi Ryan,

The way we are doing it internally is by using the non-exported function catsub2tabix, which basically does what you propose, just concatenating a list of files (see https://github.com/al2na/methylKit/blob/388770da40bde7d563224cc5d2259c2a7a6a2e08/R/tabix.functions.R#L687).
You just have to make sure to bgzip and index  the resulting file afterwards, we have methylKit:::makeMethTabix for that.

Best,
Alex

