I think I found my problem.
I was using
as(obj,'methylRawListDB')
instead of
methylRawListDB(unlist(obj), treatment = x)

so the reorganise function was not receiving a methylRawListDB obj. I guess it was seeing the new obj as a list of RawDB rather and it was trying to read the data into memory for the rearrangements.

I have changed the code and it seems to be working now....
after months of troubleshooting.... :(

Thanks Alex

